cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EpiTracer, please cite it as below."
title: "EpiTracer: Calling and Visualising Episomal Extrachromosomal DNA from Whole-Genome Sequencing"
abstract: >-
  An R package to detect episomal extrachromosomal DNA (ecDNA) amplicons —
  circles formed by simple DNA excision events rather than complex double-strand
  break processes — from whole-genome sequencing, and to visualise the
  structural rearrangements underlying focal amplifications.
type: software
authors:
